lide_008_八雲紫.wav","title":"シーン 8","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"61CD112B-6F78-47D8-A17F-60D329B3EAEE","telop":"「まさか、紫たちが追っ手を実際に出すとは…考えられなかったわ…」私は、そう呟く。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.008.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.03108843537415,"characterName":"八雲紫","duration":4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第9スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_009_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 9","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"5F48E991-7956-4BCB-95F6-C56E8F074073","telop":"「僕も、驚いてますよ…きっと、みとりさんからの電話が来なければ、あの研究所内で全員追っ手に捕まってました。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.009.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.8789115646258505,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice__FCEA","slideTitle":"第10スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_010_ナレーション.wav","title":"シーン 10","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"60EBD4F4-0F43-4175-9CDE-3FCBF15E596B","telop":"「まぁ、とりあえず、全員が無事でよかった…、それで…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.010.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.7353514739229023,"characterName":"ナレーション","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第11スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_011_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 11","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"4D6D0CE5-3258-4B67-85D8-E797E32C7345","telop":"「今後の行動計画ですか？」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.011.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":1.9756462585034014,"characterName":"操夢","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","slideTitle":"第12スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Application\/Resource\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_012_八雲紫.wav","title":"シーン 12","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"F8989D19-B4E9-4233-9E75-B2142270F55D","telop":"「ええ、そう。ここが紫にばれないとは限らないし…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.012.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.4007709750566892,"characterName":"八雲紫","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第13スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_013_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 13","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"DEB0E76C-6D31-4F9F-ABEE-831EB7F0B51A","telop":"「そうですね…、僕はそう言いながら、霊夢たちを見る。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.013.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.473469387755102,"characterName":"操夢","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第14スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_014_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 14","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"475089B4-989D-434C-8955-8D17783AE93C","telop":"すると、霊夢が口を開く。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.014.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":1.9039002267573697,"characterName":"操夢","duration":3.5},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","slideTitle":"第15スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_015_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 15","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"FB52AE63-A2C2-4050-9356-AD01DDBAE993","telop":"「ねぇ、これから私たちは、紫に追われる立場になるの？」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.015.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":4.5744897959183675,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","duration":3.5},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第16スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_016_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 16","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"6A78B058-60D3-4C5D-A202-D6F539D3F688","telop":"「霊夢さんのいう通りですね…。」\n僕はそういうと、一呼吸を置いてから、話し出す。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.016.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":5.560430839002268,"characterName":"操夢","duration":3.9000000000000004},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第17スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_017_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 17","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"8DCAF4B7-29A1-4CFB-86E8-89A2BDE1AD8E","telop":"「みとりさん…」\n僕はそう彼女に、文が記事を書ける部屋があるか尋ねる。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.017.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":4.771292517006803,"characterName":"操夢","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"slideTitle":"第18スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","title":"シーン 18","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"67B9E29E-2FA7-490B-97A7-E966540FB41D","telop":"「ええ、ありますが…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.018.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第19スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_019_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 19","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"1FF815C2-75A7-4D62-B9C6-96F6B9DC4FB0","telop":"そして僕は、文に記事の作成を依頼する。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.019.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.8430385487528347,"characterName":"操夢","duration":3.5},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%B0%84%E5%91%BD%E4%B8%B8%E6%96%87","slideTitle":"第20スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_020_射命丸文.wav","title":"シーン 20","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"11C24C57-321F-4347-BF9F-5E4F39DA6545","telop":"私は、彼の依頼を聞き、「わかりました」と返すと、その場を離れ、みとりと共にその部屋に向かっていった。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.020.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.472585034013606,"characterName":"射命丸文","duration":5},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第21スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_021_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 21","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"1276BF0A-570B-45A2-B26C-A131B9ECF8A3","telop":"僕は、二人がいなくなると、\n操作盤の前に立ち、ある画面を表示する。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.021.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":4.925646258503401,"characterName":"操夢","duration":3.5,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","slideTitle":"第22スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_022_八雲紫.wav","title":"シーン 22","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"5162DC9E-11EB-4AA2-A928-3F8E9D74E1F7","telop":"私は、例の会見後に起きた、システムの乗っ取られ騒動で急遽設けられた、情報収集室で束の間の休憩をとっていた。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.022.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.757074829931973,"characterName":"八雲紫","duration":5.300000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","slideTitle":"第23スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_023_八雲紫.wav","title":"シーン 23","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"26D5A2F1-C5AA-4FAB-9FAE-79B577AACF58","telop":"すると、誰が戸をノックする。\n「誰かしら？」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.023.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.809433106575964,"characterName":"八雲紫","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%81%AB%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","slideTitle":"第24スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_024_にとり.wav","title":"シーン 24","voiceCharacter":"にとり","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"724EEDCA-B424-4CF0-AC7E-9E8D1F853AFE","telop":"「にとりです。今、中に入っても大丈夫でしょうか？」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.024.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.9721315192743765,"characterName":"にとり","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","slideTitle":"第25スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_025_八雲紫.wav","title":"シーン 25","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"30F1D9FC-E75F-436B-9131-228555D5776E","telop":"「ええ、どうぞ。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.025.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":1.073514739229025,"characterName":"八雲紫","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","slideTitle":"第26スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_026_八雲紫.wav","title":"シーン 26","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"バウンス","id":"038F4AD9-A1E6-42A9-B54B-4558405FE88C","telop":"私がそういうと、彼女は戸を開け、入ってくる。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.026.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.0674149659863947,"characterName":"八雲紫","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","videoPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_animations\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/slide_026_anim.m4v"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%81%AB%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","slideTitle":"第27スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_027_にとり.wav","title":"シーン 27","voiceCharacter":"にとり","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"7E261404-CF0E-48CD-9FDB-9A0C8444D286","telop":"「紫様がおっしゃってた例の円球システムの乗っ取りは、一度解消され正常に戻りましたが、再び乗っ取られています。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.027.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.060226757369614,"characterName":"にとり","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","slideTitle":"第28スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_028_八雲紫.wav","title":"シーン 28","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"691661D4-CC30-4484-8AF4-E1A6C4476B4B","telop":"「どこから不正アクセスされてるの？」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.028.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":1.9589342403628118,"characterName":"八雲紫","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%81%AB%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","slideTitle":"第29スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_029_にとり.wav","title":"シーン 29","voiceCharacter":"にとり","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"F44EF5A3-45AC-44DA-B56E-E101B8E57660","telop":"「今現在も、アクセス元を調べていますが、\nなかなか特定できない状況です。そこで…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.029.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.475351473922903,"characterName":"にとり","duration":4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","slideTitle":"第30スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_030_八雲紫.wav","title":"シーン 30","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"FF84B42C-363C-459C-81D3-DBE83DAFDDE9","telop":"私は、そこで唾を飲む。すると、彼女はヒソヒソとその内容を語った。それを聞いた私は、ある人物に電話をかけた。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.030.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.271746031746032,"characterName":"八雲紫","duration":5.300000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第31スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_031_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 31","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"56A3CFEF-B038-42DD-B37B-5E672E5784C8","telop":"僕たちが、その画面…東京の某所カメラ映像を見ていると、\nそのカメラに映っている人物が電話をかける。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.031.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.075646258503402,"characterName":"操夢","duration":4.800000000000001,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第32スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_032_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 32","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"F2392378-6605-4FE1-9C3D-55FF9CDC2DEF","telop":"すると、霊夢のポケットから音が鳴る。\n僕は、霊夢に目で合図を送る。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.032.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":4.975646258503401,"characterName":"操夢","duration":3.5,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第33スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_033_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 33","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"58FC0B44-97B2-45C6-B7B6-9F034BDE4E45","telop":"そして、霊夢が部屋から出ていくと、僕はあるニュース記事を映し出す。そして、同時進行でシステムのコードを書き換えていく。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.033.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.032154195011337,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5.9,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第34スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_034_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 34","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"B1632315-40DC-41BD-9D3E-F7DD613F534C","telop":"すると、レミリアが話しかけてくる。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.034.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.2778231292517006,"characterName":"操夢","duration":3.5,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","slideTitle":"第35スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_035_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","title":"シーン 35","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"52B0936A-C861-4042-B28F-C7C65F64D318","telop":"「ねぇ、この記事に出てくる、幻想郷って何なの？」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.035.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.4546485260770976,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":3.5,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第36スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_036_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 36","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"55016E51-06DC-4960-8B0C-1F94BD2D0C62","telop":"僕は、彼女の質問には、答えずに、\n彼女たちが見ている画面をスクロールしていく。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.036.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":5.606077097505669,"characterName":"操夢","duration":3.8000000000000003,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第37スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_037_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 37","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"33952412-1ED2-4EF8-93BB-DC892D6895C7","telop":"すると、彼女たちは、驚いた表情する。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.037.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.014761904761905,"characterName":"操夢","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第38スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_038_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 38","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"5CADCC9C-E5B7-4EFC-AC2C-81244323FC04","telop":"「この記事は、幻想郷の地下深くを通るトンネルと、碓氷峠の地下を通るトンネルがつながったと記されています。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.038.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.443038548752835,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5.300000000000001,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第39スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_039_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 39","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"FAB7CF94-62D8-448D-A5D1-74EAB97A4F3C","telop":"「そして、この記事には、奥羽リニア新幹線のトンネルとつながり、自由に行き来できるとも記載されています。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.039.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.021292517006803,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5.2,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第40スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_040_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 40","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"D3F2ACCC-9353-47DC-BAB7-F0016E1C6274","telop":"「そして、この記事の公開日は3人の猛者が組んでできたゆかりん党が結束した日の1ヶ月後に公開されています。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.040.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.703038548752835,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5.300000000000001,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第41スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_041_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 41","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"4DEAD3D0-0591-499E-9770-C3328655CA97","telop":"「実は、この記事の作者は、今僕が依頼した文さんで、おそらく、紫をはじめとしたゆかりん党と裏でつながってます。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.041.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.175646258503402,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5.5,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第42スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_042_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 42","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"02753100-0D3B-4672-913D-9D240B37BCD5","telop":"「その文さんが、その裏口を閉じて、紫さんたちを裏切ったと知れ渡れば、現内閣の崩壊は時間の問題でしょう。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.042.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.021292517006803,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5.2,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","slideTitle":"第43スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_043_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","title":"シーン 43","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"A25C7AD5-850C-41A5-9B94-A1B8111964FF","telop":"「もしかして、そこまであなたは考えて実行したの？」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.043.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.2984126984126982,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":3.5,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第44スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_044_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 44","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"536240B6-2436-494E-9A05-AD2F8847D791","telop":"「いえ、ここまで完璧に推測ができれば、もっと素早い行動ができる様になりますよ。いずれは…そうなるかも知れませんが…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.044.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.021292517006803,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5.800000000000001,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","slideTitle":"第45スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_045_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","title":"シーン 45","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"6D33CD5C-1CEA-456B-8913-2C83F9E61434","telop":"「じゃあ、紫たちは、このままだと…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.045.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.592154195011338,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":3.5,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第46スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜ごくり.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_046_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 46","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"B2A1B28F-1A25-4081-853D-DA492A578BEF","telop":"すると、彼女たちの表情が変わる。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.046.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.438684807256236,"characterName":"操夢","duration":3.5},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第47スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜ごくり.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_047_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 47","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"D29FB825-AE44-48C5-821F-93FFB47C4C6F","telop":"「僕は、政党を作ることはしません。だから内閣が崩壊しても、それは実質的なことで他者から見たら、変わりません。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.047.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.443038548752835,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5.5},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第48スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜ごくり.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_048_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 48","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"6EB22565-4DCE-44CD-83A8-6DABFE8A0300","telop":"「ですが、僕はこの国のシステムを直接操作、変更することで政党不要な新たな仕組みを築き上げます…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.048.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.232154195011338,"characterName":"操夢","duration":4.800000000000001},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第49スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜ごくり.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_049_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 49","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"A8E8BA35-F2BB-4AD4-B6E7-7C51F5E5BD71","telop":"「おそらく、僕の同胞がいるので、その人たちで丸ごとシステムを操ることで、実権を直接握り締めます…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.049.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.464761904761905,"characterName":"操夢","duration":4.9},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第50スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜ごくり.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_050_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 50","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"E6A24F0E-074D-43FC-A399-BCEB06384A7B","telop":"「ですので、紫さんたちを魔理沙さんたちから見たときは、これまで通りの状態なので、気にする必要なないですよ…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.050.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.6191156462585035,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5.4},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","slideTitle":"第51スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_051_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","title":"シーン 51","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"C5E0245A-D536-4021-910F-C644D1B18C7A","telop":"「そう…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.051.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":0.5213151927437641,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":3.5,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第52スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_052_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 52","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"D97CE506-830B-492C-9B3E-7FFF08D4D27E","telop":"すると、霊夢が部屋に戻ってくる。「とりあえず一通りの作業は済んだので、魔理沙さんたちは自由に行動して大丈夫ですよ。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.052.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.116938775510205,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5.800000000000001,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","slideTitle":"第53スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_053_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 53","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"B5592DFD-AA9B-42D4-B8EE-48B2918B8410","telop":"「えっと…私は…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.053.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":1.6607482993197278,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","duration":3.5,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第54スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_054_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 54","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"E4ADEE8A-68A1-4686-A016-E31FB036B6EC","telop":"「霊夢さんは過去の馬券の購入歴について、\n聞きたいことがありますから、僕とこの部屋に残りますよ。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.054.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.597369614512472,"characterName":"操夢","duration":4.800000000000001,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第55スライド","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_055_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 55","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"F0AEA081-2057-4182-99CC-938D348A2C2E","telop":"僕はそういうと、霊夢の手を握り、こちらに引き寄せる。\n「魔理沙さんたちは自由に動いて大丈夫ですよ。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.055.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.758253968253968,"characterName":"操夢","duration":4.9,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第56スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_056_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 56","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"91767101-7893-4EE2-BB0A-4D635550C729","telop":"僕がそういうと、雰囲気で察したのか、魔理沙たちは、部屋から出ていき、部屋に残ったのは僕と霊夢の二人だけになった。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.056.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.915850340136054,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第57スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_057_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 57","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"E069F7DE-EF1B-4E42-AB00-3EBC65794BBE","telop":"「さて、あなたがこれまで購入した馬券の内容と金額、購入日時について１から教えてもらいますか…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.057.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.890861678004535,"characterName":"操夢","duration":4.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第58スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_058_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 58","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"FE7582F1-6E93-4750-BF38-DA7F33599F0F","telop":"「あと、働いている時の愚痴や不満があれば、\nここで一緒に述べてください。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.058.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":4.9321541950113374,"characterName":"操夢","duration":3.6,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第59スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_059_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 59","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"70669F45-AE83-4489-A4C3-32D33C8CC6F0","telop":"それから、僕は彼女の馬券の購入履歴と内容、\n仕事に対する愚痴や不満と一つ一つ聞き取っていた。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.059.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.93,"characterName":"操夢","duration":4.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"slideTitle":"第60スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","title":"シーン 60","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"DFB6ED24-A394-4060-9F58-687F084E697A","telop":"それからしばらく立ち二人は…","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.060.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","duration":3,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","slideTitle":"第61スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_061_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 61","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"BD95AF64-A757-4495-AEB0-768B6DB045BD","telop":"「ねぇ、あんた、私の話、聞いてるの？」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.061.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.686984126984127,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第62スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_002_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 62","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"B3A4F0B1-5DE4-46AA-A16D-3032BFAF68CA","telop":"僕は、そういう彼女の背後にそっと周り、\n片手で彼女の頭を撫でながら、片手を彼女の体に回す。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.062.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.1191156462585035,"characterName":"操夢","duration":4.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","slideTitle":"第63スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_003_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 63","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"314585B3-245F-4811-A467-DAB328D3549F","telop":"「あんた…それ…反則よ…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.063.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.4094784580498865,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","slideTitle":"第64スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_004_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 64","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"56DDD696-F5B9-4171-8361-C82F47812B79","telop":"「でも…もっと…そうなでて…。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.064.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.490748299319728,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第65スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_005_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 65","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"80949C24-147F-4F55-8F84-63BC56063755","telop":"僕は、特に何かを言うこともなく、\nただ同じような体制で、彼女の頭をそっとなで続ける。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.065.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.362607709750567,"characterName":"操夢","duration":4.1000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第66スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_066_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 66","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"32D8121D-9245-4E64-8E67-D5B3A8712598","telop":"すると、ふと霊夢が僕の腕にもたれかかる感覚を感じ、\nしっかりと支えながら、彼女の正面に回る。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.066.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.936507936507937,"characterName":"操夢","duration":4.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第67スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_067_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 67","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"9EE3B2CC-CFDE-487D-9C17-71E066423F8D","telop":"どうやら、彼女は頭を撫でられているうちに、寝落ちした様だった。僕はその彼女をそっと地面に横たわらせる。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.067.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.385419501133787,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5.1000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第68スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_068_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 68","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"8819F436-B39D-4AB7-9B32-1430F1B37F52","telop":"そして、僕は操作盤の前に立ち、先ほどのまでのコードの書き換えを進めていく。そして、数十分すると部屋の扉が開く。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.068.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.63,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第69スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_069_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 69","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"81174529-7633-4058-A842-7CF37A5EFB00","telop":"彼女は何かを言いかけるが、地面で気持ちよく眠る霊夢を見て、何かを思い出したのか、頬を赤らめる。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.069.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.793038548752834,"characterName":"操夢","duration":4.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%B0%84%E5%91%BD%E4%B8%B8%E6%96%87","slideTitle":"第70スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_070_射命丸文.wav","title":"シーン 70","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"4A57F3FB-F073-405F-9BFD-36773B666A20","telop":"「依頼された記事は…、書き終わって投稿できました…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.070.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.997596371882086,"characterName":"射命丸文","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%B0%84%E5%91%BD%E4%B8%B8%E6%96%87","slideTitle":"第71スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_071_射命丸文.wav","title":"シーン 71","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"B45F938A-3B89-454B-AB9B-AE41D7A296AA","telop":"「霊夢さんだけが、頭を撫でられて眠るなんて…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.071.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.909591836734694,"characterName":"射命丸文","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第72スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_072_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 72","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"FA3E795C-1D04-4A11-A338-2615836768B3","telop":"僕は、彼女の小言を聞き取ると、そっと背中に回り、霊夢と同じように、霊夢と同じ時間だけなでなでするのだった。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.072.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.020204081632652,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5.300000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第73スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_073_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 73","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"C8DB5282-1909-4BD3-8DA4-F5D4654549ED","telop":"そして、文も疲れたのか、眠りに落ち、僕はただ一人、操作盤の前に立つ、この国のシステムの大規模変更は始まったばかりだ。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.073.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":9.119115646258503,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第74スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_074_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 74","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"DF7272C2-AB67-441E-97B1-71B6E8301E8F","telop":"そして、同時にこれから、僕はある決断をしなければならず、\nその決断について考えを深めていくのであった。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.074.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.181065759637188,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"slideTitle":"第75スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","title":"シーン 75","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"AA90CA20-5D7C-4A57-B192-C41F11137ADA","telop":"場面が変わり…","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.075.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","duration":3,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","slideTitle":"第76スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_076_八雲紫.wav","title":"シーン 76","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"BCBAB4B0-EE2C-4FEC-AA87-DE94C0A9C3D2","telop":"私が、霊夢に電話をかけ、この問題は…異変だと言い、解決するように指示を出したが、一向に不正アクセスは実行され続ける。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.076.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.367414965986395,"characterName":"八雲紫","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","slideTitle":"第77スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_077_八雲紫.wav","title":"シーン 77","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"6B3B30F3-E398-413F-B6E8-3DD42DF708FA","telop":"すると、再び戸がノックされる。私は「どうぞ。」と返す。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.077.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":4.4379818594104306,"characterName":"八雲紫","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E8%98%AD","slideTitle":"第78スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_078_蘭.wav","title":"シーン 78","voiceCharacter":"蘭","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"13E7C2D6-3485-4DCB-8A02-040F3775F23C","telop":"「紫様…、あの射命丸文がこんな記事を先ほど投稿しまして…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.078.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":4.9819954648526075,"characterName":"蘭","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E8%98%AD","slideTitle":"第79スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_079_蘭.wav","title":"シーン 79","voiceCharacter":"蘭","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"8B345E5B-9F05-41A2-BEF6-49DC21B7A821","telop":"蘭は、印刷されたネットニュース記事をそう言いながら渡す。\nそのニュース記事には、あの記者会見は嘘つきだと書かれていた。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.079.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.966984126984126,"characterName":"蘭","duration":5.9,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E8%98%AD","slideTitle":"第80スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_080_蘭.wav","title":"シーン 80","voiceCharacter":"蘭","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"DE7EB27D-54F9-4AF2-87E4-1EC9B1E8CA07","telop":"「紫様…、これは文が紫様を裏切った…と言うことですか？」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.080.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":4.880748299319728,"characterName":"蘭","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","slideTitle":"第81スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_081_八雲紫.wav","title":"シーン 81","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"53558984-A5CD-451C-A74F-0E7173D8AEA6","telop":"「ええ、そうなるわね。きっと私たちの見てない隙に、買収されたのよ…、巨漢党の置き土産である彼にね…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.081.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.982380952380953,"characterName":"八雲紫","duration":5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","slideTitle":"第82スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_082_八雲紫.wav","title":"シーン 82","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"1838D7C7-C0E5-4893-84C8-447CDEAA49A9","telop":"「それと、彼のそばにいる霊夢の動きが見られない以上、彼女も彼に取られたことになるわ…、これは…私の失策よ…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.082.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.271632653061224,"characterName":"八雲紫","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","slideTitle":"第83スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_083_八雲紫.wav","title":"シーン 83","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"6CC0EC03-984B-4048-8578-4B2E3EE4D707","telop":"私たちがそんな話をしていると、\n誰かが部屋の戸を叩き入ってくる。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.083.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":4.198412698412699,"characterName":"八雲紫","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%A9%99","slideTitle":"第84スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_084_橙.wav","title":"シーン 84","voiceCharacter":"橙","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"7AB2DCF1-D48E-4B83-9C03-0B0181B02E43","telop":"「紫しゃま、さっき、沖縄からこんな文書が届いて…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.084.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":3.4471655328798185,"characterName":"橙","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","slideTitle":"第85スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_085_八雲紫.wav","title":"シーン 85","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"5FCF0DB3-550E-4B99-B1D3-D7FB2A84BB93","telop":"橙はそう言うと、Faxで印刷された用紙を渡す。\nその用紙には、彼が提示したある内容が記されていた。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.085.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.83984126984127,"characterName":"八雲紫","duration":5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","slideTitle":"第86スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_086_八雲紫.wav","title":"シーン 86","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"BDAACD73-9875-4341-B043-2683485EFE06","telop":"「蘭、橙、覚悟はできているかしら…。」\n私は、そう二人、そして自らにも、問いかけた。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.086.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.395759637188209,"characterName":"八雲紫","duration":4.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"id":"AA34E867-6BDF-4A50-A403-24338D22B0A8","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.087.jpeg","backgroundName":"単色背景","voiceCharacter":"","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","telop":"","slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","title":"次回予告","duration":3},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第88スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_088_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 88","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"BC612912-6B4D-41EE-830E-01EC81730B7F","telop":"僕は、文と霊夢がすやすや寝ている横で、\nこの国、いや世の仕組みを１から作り替えていた。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.088.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.016938775510204,"characterName":"操夢","duration":4.3,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第89スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_089_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 89","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"1CF4898C-87A1-463B-9ED1-AD82DBF98070","telop":"すると、みとりがやってきて、僕に進捗を聞いてくる。\n僕は、彼女にある程度進んでいると答える。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.089.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.973469387755102,"characterName":"操夢","duration":4.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"第90スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_090_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 90","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","animationName":"なし","id":"B2CC1C7A-B493-4645-A509-5070FDA7AC5C","telop":"僕は、さらに、システムの作り替えを進めていく。\nそして、先方からの連絡が入ると、沖縄を離れるのだった。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.090.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.987596371882086,"characterName":"操夢","duration":5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"id":"D3AA858C-45D0-466B-8DBB-B130B154393F","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.091.jpeg","backgroundName":"単色背景","voiceCharacter":"","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","telop":"","slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","duration":20}]